  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fiscal stability consolidation program for the development of the State of Bahia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Consolidacin del equilibrio fiscal para desarrollo Estado de Baha II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es fortalecer la sostenibilidad fiscal e incrementar las inversiones para el desarrollo del BA. Los objetivos especficos son: i) incrementar la recaudacin del ICMS; ii) fortalecer la administracin financiera y el control de los gastos pblicos; y iii) mejorar la gestin de los programas y proyectos de inversin.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programs general objective is to strengthen fiscal sustainability and increase investments for the development of the state of Bahia. The specific objectives are to: (i) increase revenue from the ICMS; (ii) strengthen financial management and control of public expenditure; and (iii) improve the management of investment programs and projects.</narrative>
  </description>
